  "instructions": [
    "Heat 1 tablespoon of vegetable oil in a large skillet or wok over medium-high heat.",
    "Add the chicken breasts and cook until browned on all sides and cooked through, about 5 minutes.",
    "Remove the chicken from the skillet and set aside.",
    "Add the remaining 1 tablespoon of vegetable oil to the skillet and add the onion, fennel seeds, ginger, and garlic. Cook until the onion is translucent, about 3-4 minutes.",
    "Add the bell peppers, carrots, and sweet potatoes to the skillet and cook until the vegetables are tender-crisp, about 4-5 minutes.",
    "Add the chili flakes, salt, and black pepper to the skillet and stir to combine.",
    "Add the cooked chicken back into the skillet and stir to combine with the vegetable mixture.",
    "Stir in the fresh cilantro and lime juice.",
    "Serve hot and enjoy!",
    "Garnish with additional cilantro and lime wedges, if desired."
  ],
